  "description": "Geum-Ju Hwang is a strong woman. Literally. Blessed with supernatural strength passed from mother to daughter for generations in her family, Geum-Ju fights bullies and takes on the challenges of modern-day Seoul. Nothing can stand up to her brawn and natural luck in her quest for success.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
